# 👔 HRM System — Human Resource Management

A complete Human Resource Management System built with **Laravel 12**, featuring employee management, attendance tracking, leave management, payroll processing, PDF payslips, and Excel reports.

---

## 📸 Project Overview

HRM System is a full-featured human resource management platform built for companies to manage their employees efficiently. HR managers can handle everything from employee onboarding to payroll generation, while employees have their own self-service portal to track attendance, apply for leaves, and download payslips.

---

## ✨ Features

### 👨‍💼 HR Manager Side
- HR Dashboard (employees, attendance, leave stats)
- Manage Departments (Add/Edit/Delete)
- Manage Designations (Add/Edit/Delete)
- Complete Employee Management (Add/Edit/Delete with photo)
- View All Employees Attendance (filter by employee/month)
- Leave Request Management (Approve/Reject with notes)
- Manage Leave Types
- Payroll Generation (automatic calculation)
- Salary Structure Management (Edit allowances/deductions)
- PDF Payslip Generation
- Excel Reports (Employee, Attendance, Payroll)

### 👤 Employee Self-Service Portal
- Employee Dashboard with Work Timer
- Clock In / Clock Out System
- Late detection (automatic status based on office time)
- My Attendance History
- Apply for Leave (with auto day calculation)
- Track Leave Status (Pending/Approved/Rejected)
- View My Payslips
- Download Payslip as PDF
- Edit My Profile (photo, phone, address)

### 📊 Reports
- Employee Report (Excel)
- Monthly Attendance Report (Excel)
- Monthly Payroll Report (Excel)

